255
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:57,067
the Kaiba Corporation will not
be responsible for your safety.

256
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,160
So go.

257
00:14:58,580 --> 00:15:01,460
Because in one hour,
this island will explode.

258
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:02,680
Say what?

259
00:15:03,060 --> 00:15:04,354
You're kidding, right?

260
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,442
Please say yes.

261
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:06,500
I don't kid.

262
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:09,520
The dual tower will
self-destruct in one hour.

263
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:11,500
So board the ship and go home.

264
00:15:12,100 --> 00:15:15,957
I thought Mokuba said that the
engines weren't working on that thing.

265
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,158
It's all right now.

266
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,017
The ship has been repaired.

267
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,100
Isn't that right?

268
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,240
Um, well, goodbye.

269
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:27,120
Can you believe that, sore loser? I know.

270
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:31,148
Kaiba loses the tournament, so
he decides to trash the place.

271
00:15:34,780 --> 00:15:36,680
Activate the detonators, Mokuba.

272
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:44,000
Activating Kaiba Corp's dual
tower detonation system.

273
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:46,440
One hour is plenty of time, right?

274
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:48,040
The ship leaves now.

275
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:49,610
All right.

276
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:52,367
Then everyone should be
a safe distance away.

277
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:54,460
So let's do this, Seto.

278
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:57,980
Access code accepted.

279
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,400
This is it.

280
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:01,860
Get ready.

281
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:04,770
Identified.

282
00:16:05,580 --> 00:16:07,060
Last but not least.

283
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:11,100
Key card A detected.

284
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:14,740
Key card B detected.

285
00:16:15,540 --> 00:16:17,400
Detonation sequence has begun.

286
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,320
Evacuate immediately.

287
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:30,000
Serenity, is my okay now?

288
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:32,680
She's not up. No way.

289
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:33,830
What gives?

290
00:16:33,913 --> 00:16:34,900
I don't know.

291
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:36,840
Wake up, Mai.

292
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:39,022
You're supposed to be all right.

293
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,230
Hear me?

294
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:44,817
Yuki beat Marek, so your mind should
have been released from the Shadow Realm.

295
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:46,620
Come on. Wake up.

296
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:48,080
I know you can do it.

297
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,520
Please, Mai.

298
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:52,717
I'd give anything in the
world to have your back.

299
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:53,630
Anything!

300
00:16:56,560 --> 00:16:57,820
It's not fair.

301
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,560
What's going on?

302
00:17:09,900 --> 00:17:11,780
That expression is priceless.

303
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:16,380
Did I hear you say you'd give
anything to have me wake up?

304
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:21,246
Because there's a few cards in that deck
of yours that I've had my eye on, Joey.

305
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:23,894
Nice doing business with you, Serenity.

306
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:25,017
You were right.

307
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:26,957
He bought it hook, line, and sinker.

308
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,060
Serenity?

309
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,900
Oh, I just couldn't resist.

310
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:33,497
I knew you guys were kidding all along.

311
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:35,760
That was not cool. Come on.

312
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:38,000
You know it was all in good fun.

313
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,390
Let's go.

314
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:42,780
I can play jokes on people, too, you know.

315
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:45,420
Hey, is that french fries I smell?

316
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:47,327
I say we take a lunch break.

317
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:48,310
Who's with me?

318
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:54,797
Sorry, guys, but I'm
afraid the donuts are gone.

319
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,417
Hey, Bakura, you're back.

320
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:59,971
Well, what are you doing in
here right in the refrigerator?

321
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:04,180
I was gone for a long time.

322
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:07,484
And there's not much to
eat in the Shadow Realm.

323
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:08,680
Go figure.

324
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:13,160
This aircraft is not going anywhere.

325
00:18:13,540 --> 00:18:15,820
Not without the Kaibas. Is that clear?

326
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:18,020
Hey, what's the deal?

327
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:19,700
We taking off or what?

328
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:22,195
We can't seem to locate Mokuba and Mr.

329
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:23,110
Kaiba.

330
00:18:23,193 --> 00:18:24,023
You're kidding me.

331
00:18:24,106 --> 00:18:25,917
This whole place is going to blow soon.

332
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:30,294
Yeah, Kaiba said the dual tower would
self-destruct in less than an hour.

333
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:32,520
Kaiba's not that dumb.

334
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:36,393
I'm sure he's hopping on board
his private jet right now.

335
00:18:36,620 --> 00:18:38,540
Well, we can't take that chance.

336
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:39,797
He's right, Joey.

337
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,497
We should go look for those guys.

338
00:18:41,580 --> 00:18:45,220
We're just way too nice. Let's go. Yeah.

339
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:48,817
Hey, do me a favor and don't
leave till we get back.

340
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:51,020
I'd like to get home in one piece.

341
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:53,720
Prepare the engines now.

342
00:18:54,300 --> 00:18:55,130
Roger.

343
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:58,640
Engaging main engines.
Voltage check. Fuel check.

344
00:18:58,980 --> 00:19:00,333
Starting rear thruster.

345
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:07,540
Oh, no. We have a problem. Huh?

346
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:08,917
I was afraid of this.

347
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,647
The engines are weak, right?

348
00:19:11,140 --> 00:19:12,964
Worse, they're completely dead.

349
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,460
This can't be.

350
00:19:14,620 --> 00:19:15,540
Wait a sec.

351
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:18,017
I thought you guys said
that they were fixed.

352
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:19,982
Does this mean we're stuck here?

353
00:19:22,260 --> 00:19:23,090
Warning.

354
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:26,377
Dual tower will
self-destruct in 45 minutes.

355
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:28,342
Evacuate the island immediately.
